    h1: 'Content audit template: decide what to keep, update, merge or remove',
    lead: 'A content audit template is a worksheet for reviewing every page on your site and giving it one decision: keep, update, expand, merge with a 301 redirect, noindex or remove. It covers the URL inventory, Search Console and GA4 data, a quality score and an action plan. Below: the full template, decision rules, an example and a free PDF.',
