        html: `<p>Numbers alone are not enough. A page with little traffic can be good and simply poorly linked, while a page with plenty of traffic can show last year's prices. So you score every page on five criteria, 0–2 points each, for a total of 0–10. It is the same scale as in our <a href="/en/tools/competitor-analysis-template">SEO competitor analysis template</a>, so you can compare your pages with your competitors' pages.</p>`,
